{"id":"n92457-1-8","stage":4,"title":"이다 · 顶","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n92457-1-8-1","ko":"머리에 인 바구니가 떨어질 것 같아요.","zh":"头上的篮子好像要掉下来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"머리에","meaning":"头，首，上头，头上","explanation":"머리：头，首，上头，头上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"5","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인","meaning":"顶","explanation":"이다：顶；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"이다","audio":"/audio/5f27e86550f797b50252.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92457","senseId":"1","lemma":"이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바구니가","meaning":"篮子，篮，筐","explanation":"바구니：篮子，篮，筐；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바구니","audio":"/audio/aefd79ef32fe1aa93eff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15797","senseId":"1","lemma":"바구니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어질","meaning":"掉，下降","explanation":"떨어지다：掉，下降；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"1","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头，首，上头，头上","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"(喻义)物体的前部或上部。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"5f27e86550f797b5","term":"이다","zh":"顶","audio":"/audio/5f27e86550f797b50252.mp3","entryId":"92457","definition":"将物品放到头顶上。","pronunciation":["이다"]},{"id":"aefd79ef32fe1aa9","term":"바구니","zh":"篮子，篮，筐","audio":"/audio/aefd79ef32fe1aa93eff.mp3","entryId":"15797","definition":"用竹子、塑料等材料编织而成的内部空间较深的容器。","pronunciation":["바구니"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"掉，下降","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"由上往下落。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c7bc25ad46a376c8e8ab.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n92457-1-8-2","ko":"한 손으로 바구니를 잡고 걸으면 돼.","zh":"用一只手扶着篮子走就行了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손으로","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바구니를","meaning":"篮子，篮，筐","explanation":"바구니：篮子，篮，筐；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"바구니","audio":"/audio/aefd79ef32fe1aa93eff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15797","senseId":"1","lemma":"바구니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잡고","meaning":"抓，揪","explanation":"잡다：抓，揪；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"잡다","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70378","senseId":"1","lemma":"잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸으면","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"aefd79ef32fe1aa9","term":"바구니","zh":"篮子，篮，筐","audio":"/audio/aefd79ef32fe1aa93eff.mp3","entryId":"15797","definition":"用竹子、塑料等材料编织而成的内部空间较深的容器。","pronunciation":["바구니"]},{"id":"b8cc8df3de72c173","term":"잡다","zh":"抓，揪","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3","entryId":"70378","definition":"用手握住不放。","pronunciation":["잡따"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f20b51f0a8b814d23934.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.082,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=92457","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["头上的篮子好像要掉下来了。","用一只手扶着篮子走就行了。","国语老师在哪儿？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["头上的篮子好像要掉下来了。","用一只手扶着篮子走就行了。","国语老师在哪儿？"],"answer":1}]}
